src/mlx_serve/ (generated by scripts/prepare.sh, not committed) holds the files of mlx-serve's src/ this plugin compiles,
at their mlx-serve paths, from the commit in MLX_SERVE_REF, with the Metal kernels they and the plugin embed.
overlay/mlx_serve/ is copied over it: the files in the script's EDGES list, which are this plugin's own code at
mlx-serve paths, not copies; and each copy and kernel whose text at mlx-serve commit 1b3e624b (the tip of
davidtai/mlx-serve:qwen4-exp-paths, ddalcu/mlx-serve#1005's head), as the script writes it from there, differs from
what it writes at the ref. The overlay's .metal files are mlx-serve's kernels at 1b3e624b, byte for byte. A `stand_in`
file is an empty one for an import nothing compiled uses.

